{"id":"m2://rec/open_logic/content/sets-functions-relations/arithmetization/checking-details.tex#defn-2#1","source":"open_logic","snapshot":"blake3:a5eb116529d3e799289dd9f7e7530d0d446b3615f5608fe08c668241eee3c765","locator":"https://github.com/OpenLogicProject/OpenLogic/blob/1e960beff9ed7835bf3e3f1335e21af3439cd107/content/sets-functions-relations/arithmetization/checking-details.tex#L111","native_id":"content/sets-functions-relations/arithmetization/checking-details.tex#defn-2","kind":"definition","text":"An \\emph{ordered ring} is a commutative ring which is also equipped\r\nwith a total order relation, $\\leq$, such that:\r\n\\begin{align*}\r\n\ta \\leq b &\\lif a + c \\leq b + c\\\\\r\n\t(a \\leq b \\land 0 \\leq c) &\\lif a \\times c \\leq b \\times c\r\n\\end{align*}","class":"open","by":"textbook/1","resource":"PKGMM3P5QY","at":{"section":"78.2","kind":"defn"}}
